WEBVTT

00:31.114 --> 00:33.950
THE TRUNK

01:57.158 --> 01:59.077
I saw Eom Tae-seong
by your house.

01:59.702 --> 02:01.079
You need some pepper spray?

02:31.609 --> 02:34.988
My mom gave me that when I was little
so I wouldn't have nightmares.

02:37.282 --> 02:40.618
Looked like your dream wasn't so nice.
What was it about?

02:44.873 --> 02:46.040
I couldn't tell you.

02:47.417 --> 02:49.419
It's rare to remember dreams, you know.

02:53.006 --> 02:54.048
Didn't know that.

02:54.799 --> 02:56.301
Mine are always so vivid.

02:59.095 --> 03:01.556
"All life originated in the water,
so we're not dying."

03:01.639 --> 03:05.101
"We're just taking a little rest."
That's what I was always told.

03:06.060 --> 03:07.770
'Cause of this, I could sleep for a while.

03:09.522 --> 03:12.025
But I started having nightmares
after my mom died.

03:13.526 --> 03:16.446
What nightmare was vivid enough
that you needed something like this?

03:16.529 --> 03:17.363
Lots of them.

03:18.156 --> 03:21.409
In one of them, I was on a crowded street,
and I just melt away.

03:22.911 --> 03:25.997
I try to yell and shout,
only my voice would get drowned out.

03:27.916 --> 03:29.375
I was dying alone. Then it…

03:31.294 --> 03:32.295
was over.

03:34.255 --> 03:35.632
What's so wrong with dying alone?

03:37.592 --> 03:40.470
It might be more peaceful
to die alone, actually.

03:43.056 --> 03:46.851
Sure, you're by yourself.
Fear just makes us forget that though.

03:47.769 --> 03:50.146
It's not like
there's anything we can do, right?

03:50.939 --> 03:52.941
Once you accept the truth, it's freeing.

03:54.192 --> 03:55.526
And how would we

03:56.736 --> 03:59.155
ever love anyone else
unless we're totally alone?

04:03.534 --> 04:05.620
It sounds like you were in love before.

04:11.084 --> 04:12.585
So what about your bad dreams?

04:15.088 --> 04:16.089
They don't usually--

04:16.172 --> 04:17.799
Do you see Eom Tae-seong in them?

04:20.510 --> 04:21.594
Who is Eom Tae-seong?

04:22.303 --> 04:24.889
Do you really need pepper spray?
Is he that bad?

04:32.021 --> 04:33.273
He's a stalker.

04:34.983 --> 04:37.110
He's been stalking me for five years now.

04:37.610 --> 04:40.571
It's possible he's watching us
from outside the house right now.

04:41.489 --> 04:42.865
Have you called the police?

04:45.785 --> 04:47.078
God, of course you have.

04:48.496 --> 04:50.498
Well, what more can we do about it now?

04:50.581 --> 04:53.334
You can't do anything about it.
That's protocol.

04:55.712 --> 04:57.422
Eom Tae-seong is my issue.

04:57.922 --> 04:59.799
He doesn't affect our relationship.

05:01.134 --> 05:02.468
Don't let this bother you.

05:13.396 --> 05:16.441
It's a client introduction,
so this shouldn't take long.

05:16.524 --> 05:18.192
Okay, I'll call you
when I get there.

05:18.276 --> 05:20.320
Aren't you busy?
You don't have to come here.

05:20.820 --> 05:22.655
Just depends on how much I get done.

05:22.739 --> 05:25.658
Just take it easy.
I'm tired, so I'll be home early anyway.

05:29.245 --> 05:30.580
Floor two.

05:31.873 --> 05:32.749
Doors closing.

05:43.801 --> 05:45.053
Lee Seo-yeon?

05:52.602 --> 05:53.978
Eom Tae-seong. Pleasure.

05:55.063 --> 05:56.856
I think we met
at the Heritage Lounge earlier.

06:00.651 --> 06:01.569
Oh, I…

06:02.862 --> 06:03.988
I don't recall that.

06:04.489 --> 06:07.325
Well, that's okay.
Not like we shook hands, so…

06:07.408 --> 06:08.576
It's just a bunch of tricks.

06:08.659 --> 06:11.079
He's not really employing
traditional techniques.

06:16.501 --> 06:17.585
Uh, sit down.

06:25.134 --> 06:28.221
I was told you're looking for a workshop
and gallery that's around five stories.

06:28.304 --> 06:30.431
Here are some samples for you to consider.

06:31.641 --> 06:32.517
It's odd, I know.

06:34.644 --> 06:38.022
I used to wear them when I was in jail.
Now it's just for fun.

06:38.648 --> 06:40.566
They're actually kinda comforting too.

06:43.778 --> 06:44.904
I know you were

06:46.114 --> 06:47.949
curious about the shoes, that's all.

06:52.078 --> 06:55.123
Well, no, I'm not one
to pry into other people's personal lives.

06:55.206 --> 06:57.125
Mm, you seemed pretty interested.

06:58.626 --> 06:59.877
I'm not sure if I--

06:59.961 --> 07:01.045
Noh In-ji.

07:04.674 --> 07:07.677
Why are you so interested in Noh In-ji?
Can you explain that?

07:08.177 --> 07:09.387
You stupid skank.

07:21.065 --> 07:23.025
Look, I have nothing against skanks.

07:23.109 --> 07:25.820
Just don't… screw with In-ji.

07:26.571 --> 07:27.655
Just don't do it.

07:31.284 --> 07:33.536
Is that… clear?

07:45.006 --> 07:47.216
If you wanna know the truth about me,

07:48.885 --> 07:50.219
NM is your best bet.

07:51.846 --> 07:55.057
While you're at it, ask them
what I might do if you don't listen.

08:00.688 --> 08:01.647
Okay, good.

08:02.482 --> 08:04.400
Email me those samples. Thanks.

08:06.152 --> 08:07.361
Ms. Lee Seo-yeon.

09:11.008 --> 09:12.802
Did you not get my texts last night?

09:12.885 --> 09:14.220
You weren't replying.

09:15.763 --> 09:17.557
I fell asleep early. Sorry.

09:19.809 --> 09:23.437
Eom Tae-seong is going to show up
before you know it. You gotta be ready.

09:24.021 --> 09:25.648
You must've seen the pic I sent.

09:26.857 --> 09:28.317
You need it, I'm good for it.

09:28.401 --> 09:31.112
Guns, grenades, whatever you want,
I'm totally on it.

09:34.282 --> 09:36.867
Just say the word.
The moment you tell me, I got it.

09:36.951 --> 09:37.785
Really.

09:38.786 --> 09:41.038
I'll kill that weasel,
and I won't bat an eye.

09:43.499 --> 09:44.917
You're not doing anything.

09:45.918 --> 09:47.086
I'll do it.

09:48.754 --> 09:49.589
Si-jeong.

09:50.798 --> 09:52.341
Ask a man out on a date.

09:57.096 --> 09:58.055
What for?

10:00.141 --> 10:01.392
Listen, I'm miserable enough.

10:01.475 --> 10:04.854
I don't think I wanna roll the dice
on a new relationship right now.

10:05.521 --> 10:08.649
There's a way higher chance of it
being a disaster than working out.

10:09.442 --> 10:12.028
I thought our friendship would be over
when Hye-yeong died.

10:12.528 --> 10:14.113
So why are you still this nice?

10:16.574 --> 10:18.784
I only ever had three friends, honestly.

10:19.452 --> 10:21.787
Now I have two,
so I'm just trying to help out.

10:34.467 --> 10:36.427
Look into Seo-yeon for me, okay?

10:37.219 --> 10:39.013
She's Jeong-won's ex-wife.

10:39.972 --> 10:41.474
Find out where she gets the drugs.

10:42.266 --> 10:43.267
Is she a junkie?

10:43.768 --> 10:46.812
No. A pusher, I think.
And she's really spiteful.

10:53.944 --> 10:55.321
I don't think I can make it.

10:56.447 --> 10:58.199
I gotta see a few old coworkers.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.743
It's been forever, so…

11:02.411 --> 11:04.914
I just got in the car
to go home anyway.

11:05.414 --> 11:06.624
See you at home.

11:22.598 --> 11:24.684
Must've been that gathering
where I met him initially.

11:25.267 --> 11:27.478
He was handsome
and did pretty good work too.

11:28.020 --> 11:29.563
So everyone started talking

11:30.356 --> 11:31.691
about him really quickly.

11:33.693 --> 11:36.112
Was he introduced to Noh In-ji
at that time as well?

11:37.113 --> 11:38.906
Jeong-won's wife, do you mean her?

11:39.824 --> 11:40.658
No.

11:41.242 --> 11:43.244
If anything, I think she knew Seo-yeon.

11:44.704 --> 11:45.538
Lee Seo-yeon?

11:46.539 --> 11:47.373
Yes.

11:48.374 --> 11:51.001
I believe I saw the two… of them meet.

11:53.879 --> 11:55.047
Lee Seo-yeon?

11:56.215 --> 11:59.552
I was wondering if it was you.
I saw you at the back of the restaurant.

11:59.635 --> 12:01.470
I was there for a parent-teacher meeting.

12:01.971 --> 12:04.223
I knew you'd nail it,
and you'd spot me too.

12:07.518 --> 12:08.853
Cramps suck, I know.

12:08.936 --> 12:11.897
I hope they go away.
I just took a little Advil.

12:11.981 --> 12:13.899
God, you make me so jealous.

12:16.026 --> 12:18.487
If our lives
were all painted in one color,

12:18.571 --> 12:20.489
I feel like mine would be totally ash.

12:20.573 --> 12:21.907
It's just gray and boring.

12:24.118 --> 12:25.745
At least you have your kids.

12:26.704 --> 12:28.205
I'd be happy to get rid of them.

12:32.418 --> 12:34.920
Honestly, it'd be amazing
to stuff them back into my stomach.

12:35.004 --> 12:37.131
I mean, I have the worst luck with them,
and it just…

12:37.214 --> 12:39.550
Ugh, it feels like
we are attached forever.

12:40.301 --> 12:42.845
At least things were quiet
before they were born, you know?

12:42.928 --> 12:43.846
Ever since we had kids,

12:43.929 --> 12:46.599
it's like I'm just growing
all these new umbilical cords, I swear.

12:47.099 --> 12:50.352
You know those weird alien parasites
in all the sci-fi flicks?

12:50.436 --> 12:51.604
It's sorta like that.

12:52.188 --> 12:54.356
If it's really that rough,
you could get a divorce.

12:55.024 --> 12:56.984
But we hold hands at the grocery store,

12:58.277 --> 12:59.987
and I'm not ready to let that go.

13:02.782 --> 13:04.575
You met with Eom Tae-seong, right?

13:09.330 --> 13:10.664
Oh, yeah, I saw him there earlier.

13:10.748 --> 13:13.167
He's the, uh, guy who makes works of art
out of rice cakes.

13:13.250 --> 13:17.004
And I think we had some of those
when Jeong-won got his lights replaced.

13:18.756 --> 13:21.634
Oh, hey!
This is where you're hiding!

13:58.587 --> 14:00.422
What are you doing here?

14:01.590 --> 14:03.050
You're curious about that?

14:04.510 --> 14:07.221
I thought you would want to know
how you ended up here to begin with.

14:13.519 --> 14:15.020
If you had gotten here a little later,

14:15.104 --> 14:16.856
they would've done a hysterectomy,
you know.

14:17.356 --> 14:20.150
They only had to remove
one of your ovaries, thankfully.

14:20.901 --> 14:24.738
But the other one is not in great shape,
so you'll need to continue treatment.

14:26.699 --> 14:28.158
The bell is right back there.

14:28.784 --> 14:31.412
And I'll make sure the nurse knows
you're awake on my way out.

14:31.495 --> 14:33.706
What happened? The last thing I remember…

14:34.498 --> 14:36.417
I think Yoon-a was driving.

14:36.500 --> 14:38.669
She said her kids were
getting back from camp today.

14:39.253 --> 14:41.380
She asked me to stay with you
in her place.

14:41.463 --> 14:43.674
She may be a bit slow, but there's

14:43.757 --> 14:47.136
no way she's dumb enough
to tell you to come here for a visit.

14:49.263 --> 14:50.598
Jeong-won left his phone at home.

14:50.681 --> 14:53.309
That's why I picked up instead
'cause I didn't wanna miss the call.

14:54.226 --> 14:57.563
He wasn't in his workshop.
I kept trying, but I couldn't reach him.

14:59.064 --> 15:00.733
Yoon Ji-o had to run an errand.

15:01.859 --> 15:04.278
I figured you'd appreciate
knowing that too.

15:05.362 --> 15:06.822
I bet you're happy, huh?

15:06.906 --> 15:08.991
Learned a lot about me, didn't you?

15:09.074 --> 15:12.286
Well, I'm sure you had fun
studying me too, Seo-yeon.

15:19.376 --> 15:20.294
Why do you say that?

15:21.462 --> 15:22.922
Honestly, I just have a feeling

15:23.005 --> 15:25.674
you've done a lot more research
than I have, that's all.

15:27.593 --> 15:31.347
I'm sure you've… at least seen my CV.

15:33.098 --> 15:37.311
If you had, you'd know
I want… this marriage to work.

15:37.394 --> 15:41.148
Oh, so… did you and Jeong-won make love?

15:50.282 --> 15:51.700
What the hell are you doing?

15:52.284 --> 15:54.286
Your catheter tube fell out.

15:56.789 --> 16:00.542
That's why you… need someone here
at your bedside, you know.

16:17.434 --> 16:20.020
- Oh, sh… should I try this too?
- That's it.

16:20.104 --> 16:21.897
- Wait, I'm going down.
- Go down.

16:21.981 --> 16:23.983
- I'm going, here I go.
- Do it.

17:40.642 --> 17:41.560
Yo.

17:43.062 --> 17:44.146
Dude!

17:47.232 --> 17:49.443
Why don't you answer your phone, dumbass?

17:51.070 --> 17:52.488
We have to go right now.

18:02.414 --> 18:04.583
She's all changed now.
You can go in.

18:20.974 --> 18:22.017
You all right?

18:22.518 --> 18:24.520
They told me
I should get my IUD removed,

18:24.603 --> 18:25.854
but I said no.

18:25.938 --> 18:27.773
Another pregnancy? I don't want that.

18:28.398 --> 18:30.567
I'm sure I should've listened
to the doctor.

18:31.360 --> 18:34.363
You know how I get.
I'm just too stubborn, you know?

18:34.988 --> 18:36.615
We had some options. Why'd you do this?

18:37.366 --> 18:39.409
None of it felt right to me, I guess.

18:40.702 --> 18:44.164
I almost had to get a hysterectomy,
but it didn't quite come to that,

18:44.248 --> 18:46.125
so I guess I'll keep menstruating.

18:46.667 --> 18:47.835
Not that it matters.

18:48.418 --> 18:50.838
The odds of me getting pregnant
are really low anyway.

18:53.215 --> 18:54.091
Seo-yeon.

18:55.551 --> 18:56.510
Do you

18:57.886 --> 18:59.638
want another baby, Jeong-won?

19:05.185 --> 19:07.646
Ma'am, your husband… begged us.

19:07.729 --> 19:08.981
He was very upset.

19:11.066 --> 19:11.984
I don't think…

19:13.986 --> 19:15.612
having a child would be good for you.

19:19.700 --> 19:21.118
You know why I say that?

19:33.255 --> 19:36.717
OPERATION AND ANESTHESIA CONSENT FORM

19:42.514 --> 19:43.515
Excuse me.

19:45.517 --> 19:46.393
The child.

19:47.769 --> 19:49.313
Save the child first, please.

20:21.011 --> 20:23.805
Fuck me. They are alive.

21:07.432 --> 21:08.642
Eom Tae-seong?

21:12.187 --> 21:13.146
It is you.

21:28.912 --> 21:29.997
What are you doing?

21:30.580 --> 21:32.040
I'm lifting the shadows.

21:32.958 --> 21:34.501
You said we should confront the truth.

22:04.906 --> 22:06.366
What is it you do for work?

22:07.492 --> 22:08.577
Rice cakes.

22:09.619 --> 22:11.788
Apprenticed for a brilliant guy.

22:11.872 --> 22:13.081
A master of the craft.

22:13.165 --> 22:14.333
I could've taken his place,

22:14.416 --> 22:18.628
but he would whale on me so often
that I couldn't deal with it.

22:31.224 --> 22:32.517
I noticed you have…

22:34.728 --> 22:37.647
no security cameras
watching over this amazing place.

22:38.940 --> 22:40.567
Must have a lot of secrets.

22:42.277 --> 22:44.988
Or cameras… aren't your thing.

23:19.523 --> 23:21.608
The tea is amazing. Really.

23:22.359 --> 23:23.568
She's a great cook too.

23:23.652 --> 23:26.363
She was a model student
since her days at the workshop.

23:28.907 --> 23:30.117
She's so cool.

23:33.912 --> 23:36.665
I'd love to make you dohaengbyung
next time.

23:36.748 --> 23:40.085
You start with the dried apricots
and powder these little short grain rice.

23:40.168 --> 23:41.962
Then you…

23:42.045 --> 23:43.296
The old man taught me.

23:43.839 --> 23:45.424
He used to beat my ass when he taught me,

23:45.507 --> 23:47.717
and I couldn't sleep
because the bruising was so terrible.

23:47.801 --> 23:49.261
But that's what made them so…

23:50.303 --> 23:51.263
so good.

24:00.689 --> 24:01.606
Do you smoke, man?

24:39.102 --> 24:39.936
I have money.

24:44.024 --> 24:47.694
I've been wondering how good it would feel
if I utilized it to obliterate you.

24:49.154 --> 24:51.072
The truth is, I have a lot of options.

24:51.573 --> 24:53.783
Even though I could probably ruin you,

24:54.826 --> 24:57.078
I thought I'd give you more of a chance.

24:57.162 --> 24:59.206
Meet you and talk.

25:02.334 --> 25:04.461
You need to stay the hell away from In-ji.

25:04.961 --> 25:07.214
That way, I won't have to
waste money on this shit.

25:13.553 --> 25:17.015
I heard rich people don't spend money
without the promise of a return.

25:18.058 --> 25:20.560
Who is that woman to you?
Go ahead, Jeong-won.

25:21.770 --> 25:22.729
Why her?

25:23.688 --> 25:24.856
Ah!

25:24.940 --> 25:27.901
You think In-ji is actually
becoming your wife now.

25:27.984 --> 25:28.944
Oh.

25:34.366 --> 25:36.243
Don't ever come near her again.

25:36.826 --> 25:39.538
You think you know that woman
like I do?

25:41.873 --> 25:44.751
You… you trust her?
You really believe her?

25:48.630 --> 25:51.550
NOH IN-JI
DO YOU TRUST HER?

25:52.717 --> 25:54.636
You sent me a text, didn't you?

25:56.388 --> 25:57.514
Han Jeong-won.

25:59.099 --> 25:59.933
You idiot.

26:01.434 --> 26:03.770
You're just a producer at a record label.

26:05.313 --> 26:08.692
Tell me. How do you think you're going to
ruin a life that's already destroyed?

26:08.775 --> 26:10.068
Do you think that's easy, huh?

26:10.151 --> 26:13.071
You have no idea
how far down rock bottom goes.

26:13.154 --> 26:14.948
Do you think you can ruin me, rich boy?

26:15.031 --> 26:18.785
Because that's exactly the kind of story
people wanna hear, you little shitheel.

26:22.539 --> 26:23.957
You fucking psycho.

26:24.040 --> 26:25.125
Mm.

26:26.209 --> 26:28.795
Do you think Noh In-ji is gonna
love you, Jeong-won?

26:29.588 --> 26:30.422
Really, huh?

26:31.423 --> 26:32.841
You seriously believe that?

26:34.259 --> 26:35.552
Think she knows that…

26:37.929 --> 26:40.473
that you killed your mother?
Does she know?

26:42.642 --> 26:43.643
You son of a…

26:47.230 --> 26:50.317
You crazy piece of shit.

27:10.045 --> 27:12.297
A lot of folks around here
set off fireworks by the lake,

27:12.380 --> 27:15.258
so people don't pay too much attention
to loud noises.

27:15.800 --> 27:18.887
Plus, it rained a lot this morning,
so there's not much to see here.

27:19.971 --> 27:21.306
Oh, here. Sorry.

27:22.432 --> 27:24.225
What about the guy's stab wound?

27:26.102 --> 27:27.520
It's been there for a while.

27:28.772 --> 27:30.398
The moron didn't see a doctor.

27:30.482 --> 27:32.692
He bought tape at a pharmacy
and put that on.

27:38.531 --> 27:39.824
The coffee sucks.

28:03.807 --> 28:04.808
He's gone.

28:12.399 --> 28:14.984
Well, it's been a… really long day.

28:47.016 --> 28:49.060
I wanted
to have a child of my own.

28:51.312 --> 28:52.397
That way,

28:53.273 --> 28:56.025
I wouldn't just have to
keep on living as someone's son.

28:57.902 --> 29:00.447
I could be a father
from that point forward.

29:02.907 --> 29:04.159
But it didn't work out.

29:05.535 --> 29:06.453
Why not?

29:08.163 --> 29:10.665
I guess she preferred
not to have kids in her life.

29:11.875 --> 29:14.002
I think I pushed it on her from the start.

30:06.930 --> 30:08.264
It happened because of me.

30:10.099 --> 30:12.143
People still think it was an accident,

30:13.520 --> 30:15.438
that she collapsed 'cause she felt sick.

30:15.939 --> 30:18.316
And that's what Seo-yeon told the doctor.

30:19.776 --> 30:22.529
A mother who was already
in her third trimester.

30:23.530 --> 30:26.699
She would've felt the child
moving and kicking more than ever before.

30:26.783 --> 30:27.742
Then…

30:31.162 --> 30:33.623
then, without a thought,
she runs into the street.

30:34.249 --> 30:36.084
How do you explain that to anyone?

30:46.052 --> 30:48.638
You heard of the… blue pill?

30:50.890 --> 30:52.892
Basically, there's a blue and a red one.

30:53.434 --> 30:54.811
If you take the blue one,

30:54.894 --> 30:58.356
you're completely unaware of the truth,
so it makes you see things how you want.

30:58.857 --> 31:01.025
You're blissfully ignorant, and you

31:02.026 --> 31:03.736
get used to living in that world.

31:07.490 --> 31:08.741
What's the red one do?

31:09.951 --> 31:12.161
Basically, it dispels all your illusions.

31:13.329 --> 31:15.456
Makes you see the brutal truth.

31:19.711 --> 31:21.713
That's when it began. I started to feel…

31:24.090 --> 31:26.259
like I was desperate to escape my wife.

31:29.137 --> 31:32.515
I really wanted that child to live
more than her.

31:34.142 --> 31:35.643
She found out about it, right?

31:39.814 --> 31:41.983
I don't know why I felt that way.

31:42.066 --> 31:43.067
I, uh…

31:44.819 --> 31:46.321
You know why, Jeong-won.

31:49.908 --> 31:51.868
This was not about saving a life.

31:53.119 --> 31:54.746
I think it was about taking one.

31:55.997 --> 31:57.498
In-ji learned jujitsu

31:57.582 --> 31:59.709
because she was so afraid
of Eom Tae-seong.

32:00.960 --> 32:02.837
We had him put in a mental facility,

32:04.589 --> 32:05.715
though it didn't take.

32:05.798 --> 32:07.800
Wait, I thought he was in jail.

32:08.676 --> 32:10.428
He was wearing those sneakers.

32:11.304 --> 32:13.306
The kind you usually see prisoners wear.

32:13.848 --> 32:14.682
Those.

32:16.100 --> 32:18.144
Assault, attempted murder, and theft.

32:18.811 --> 32:22.357
Aside from stalking,
he already had a criminal record.

32:23.816 --> 32:26.486
You said you had him committed, right?
How?

32:27.445 --> 32:31.616
Eom Tae-seong attacked
an… NM security employee four years ago.

32:31.699 --> 32:32.867
Broke his neck in front of me.

32:38.790 --> 32:41.751
I tried going to the cops over and over,
but it didn't work.

32:42.710 --> 32:44.879
I even tried to catch him with a GPS once.

32:46.172 --> 32:50.385
And they just couldn't do anything…
until I died or got beaten up by him.

32:51.052 --> 32:53.429
Don't worry. I'll get good security.
It's gonna be okay.

32:54.389 --> 32:56.724
Eom Tae-seong broke this guy's neck
like snapping a branch.

32:56.808 --> 32:57.725
He was security.

32:58.226 --> 32:59.477
Keepers, they call them.

32:59.560 --> 33:01.187
Bastard.

33:03.189 --> 33:04.607
What are you looking at?

33:06.275 --> 33:07.777
What's wrong, hmm?

33:10.071 --> 33:11.531
Stay still!

33:11.614 --> 33:14.784
They're usually ex-special forces
or former Secret Service agents,

33:14.867 --> 33:16.828
sometimes Olympic athletes.

33:18.871 --> 33:20.832
Eom Tae-seong is more of a risk
to people around me

33:20.915 --> 33:22.583
than he is to my personal safety.

33:25.128 --> 33:28.006
He always finds a way
to show who's in charge.

33:31.718 --> 33:34.429
He has to keep me powerless
so only he's in control.

33:40.518 --> 33:44.188
The company dealt with it quietly.
They reached a settlement with the family.

33:44.272 --> 33:47.233
Eom Tae-seong was then committed
at their urging.

33:47.316 --> 33:49.610
Please tell me we can put him back there.

33:50.820 --> 33:54.574
If we were to get involved again,
he'd surrender to the authorities,

33:54.657 --> 33:58.911
and I'd have a lot of explaining to do
at the police station,

33:59.412 --> 34:00.496
as I'm sure you know.

34:01.164 --> 34:02.457
In the course of that,

34:03.833 --> 34:07.211
NM would… lose its confidential status.

34:09.714 --> 34:11.424
He also said I

34:12.759 --> 34:14.719
should ask NM
what happens if I don't listen.

34:17.889 --> 34:20.183
I suggest you either stop
what you were doing…

34:22.185 --> 34:24.312
or learn jujitsu. Be careful.

34:50.588 --> 34:52.632
He was always
such a prick to me.

34:53.299 --> 34:55.551
Said our marriage
wasn't good for his company.

34:57.428 --> 34:58.763
He's gotta be in, uh,

35:00.139 --> 35:03.267
the top five worst assholes
I've ever met in my entire life.

35:05.561 --> 35:07.647
He definitely seems at peace
for such a bad guy.

35:10.942 --> 35:11.776
You're right.

35:15.780 --> 35:16.781
Hey, what are you doing?

35:16.864 --> 35:17.782
What? He can't feel it.

35:17.865 --> 35:20.118
I'm the only one
who might feel shitty about it.

35:34.006 --> 35:35.550
It's just a reflex.

35:36.509 --> 35:37.927
He's not conscious or anything.

35:39.262 --> 35:40.555
Seo-yeon found him like this.

35:42.306 --> 35:45.351
I guess she was here,
and she wanted to see him.

35:48.312 --> 35:51.274
He doesn't have much time.
Prepare yourself.

35:59.282 --> 36:01.701
I haven't looked him in the eyes
for a long time.

36:03.327 --> 36:04.412
Can't believe it.

37:16.651 --> 37:19.028
This is for you to change into, sir.

37:20.321 --> 37:23.783
- Whoever gave it to you, did they leave?
- Yes, as they dropped it off.

37:34.252 --> 37:37.004
Yeah, set that up.
Right, I understand. Thank you.

37:37.088 --> 37:39.548
AS WISHED BY THE DECEASED,
CONDOLENCE MONEY IS DECLINED

37:39.632 --> 37:41.717
Oh, here, just leave it here,
next to the column.

37:41.801 --> 37:42.635
Uh, yep, just two.

37:45.805 --> 37:47.223
I think we came too early.

37:49.267 --> 37:51.269
Wait, Seo-yeon's nowhere to be found.

37:52.144 --> 37:54.981
- You think she'll come?
- Why the hell would she?

37:55.064 --> 37:56.941
Well, he was her father-in-law, so…

37:58.901 --> 38:01.070
Oh boy. She can't wear that.

38:05.825 --> 38:06.951
Has she lost her mind?

38:21.799 --> 38:23.676
Still can't put on your own tie, huh?

38:26.470 --> 38:28.639
You don't have to wear
mourning clothes, Seo-yeon.

38:28.723 --> 38:30.891
Well, people are gonna gossip anyway.

38:31.684 --> 38:33.519
Better than being
the horrible daughter-in-law

38:33.602 --> 38:34.770
who missed the funeral.

38:35.938 --> 38:37.732
I went to his hospital room, you know.

38:38.316 --> 38:41.235
I might have been the one
who killed your father, actually, so, um…

38:43.279 --> 38:44.780
What are you telling me?

38:47.325 --> 38:49.201
The look on my face can do that.

38:50.411 --> 38:53.080
This is a good thing, Jeong-won.
He's done torturing you.

38:53.164 --> 38:55.333
And, plus,
he doesn't have to live in agony.

38:56.542 --> 38:57.960
These ones are nonaddictive.

38:59.295 --> 39:01.964
In America,
even hospitals give these to people

39:02.048 --> 39:04.342
in case the pills you're on
don't work anymore.

39:10.348 --> 39:11.849
The tie, I can't help you with.

39:12.350 --> 39:14.935
You know the employees
probably know some fancy knots.

39:15.019 --> 39:16.562
They're pros with that stuff.

39:17.271 --> 39:18.397
See you in there.

40:41.814 --> 40:42.940
Where were you, In-ji?

40:44.191 --> 40:45.276
Not far.

40:48.446 --> 40:49.822
Will you stay close to me?

40:50.322 --> 40:52.867
Technically,
I can't attend official events.

40:52.950 --> 40:54.410
The manual prohibits it.

40:55.911 --> 40:57.246
Didn't you want a…

40:59.123 --> 41:00.833
a quiet wedding, Jeong-won?

41:02.918 --> 41:05.212
You and your manual.

41:08.090 --> 41:10.050
There you go. Go inside.

41:15.848 --> 41:17.308
I can't do it without you.

41:20.686 --> 41:21.562
I know.

41:43.125 --> 41:47.046
Doesn't getting her ovaries removed…
make a woman go all crazy?

41:47.129 --> 41:48.797
Oh my God! Quiet! Sh!

41:48.881 --> 41:50.841
What is she doing
at someone else's funeral?

41:50.925 --> 41:52.384
What about her husband, Ji-o?

41:53.344 --> 41:56.764
She's known them since she was little.
So what if she's here more as a daughter?

41:56.847 --> 41:59.016
I mean, ya know,
Jeong-won's an only child, so…

41:59.099 --> 42:01.477
A daughter-in-law is excommunicated
after a divorce.

42:01.977 --> 42:03.687
When's the last time a divorcée

42:03.771 --> 42:06.398
showed up to
her rich former father-in-law's funeral?

42:06.482 --> 42:09.485
A daughter? You're kidding!
They were never that close.

42:09.568 --> 42:11.570
So where is Ms. Noh? I don't…

42:12.238 --> 42:14.865
- I'd be losing my cool if I saw that.
- Hush. Sh.

42:24.625 --> 42:26.961
- She's here. She's here!
- Huh? Wh… what?

42:27.044 --> 42:27.920
What are you doing?

42:40.140 --> 42:42.476
Are they…
seriously gonna do this?

42:44.812 --> 42:45.896
Uh…

42:45.980 --> 42:46.981
Oh my…

42:54.238 --> 42:55.573
You don't need to be here.

42:56.115 --> 42:58.617
No one would think less of you
if you skipped this.

42:59.451 --> 43:01.161
It's okay. I'm doing this for you.

43:02.746 --> 43:04.582
What do you mean you're doing it for me?

43:05.749 --> 43:09.628
No one's here to find out how a man
who was in a coma could've passed away.

43:09.712 --> 43:11.422
They'll say,
"Well, he was on his way out."

43:12.047 --> 43:13.591
It's you they're gonna judge.

43:16.010 --> 43:19.888
In their eyes, you're a lazy failure
who's wasting his life more every day.

43:19.972 --> 43:22.182
What they're gonna be saying
when they leave,

43:22.266 --> 43:24.184
"He was so alone."
"Clearly, he's a broken man."

43:24.268 --> 43:26.186
"What if he starts doing drugs again?"

43:27.396 --> 43:29.773
Your audience is just
a bunch of judgmental jerks.

43:29.857 --> 43:31.525
You wanna make them gossip more?

43:33.360 --> 43:35.279
That woman is gonna make it worse.

43:35.779 --> 43:37.948
Only I really know you.

43:39.533 --> 43:42.703
Honey, people won't go easy on you.

43:43.203 --> 43:45.414
The scandalous downfall
of a dead CEO's son.

43:45.497 --> 43:48.083
It'd be a feeding frenzy
of rumors and gossip.

43:48.167 --> 43:49.418
Think about it.

43:50.002 --> 43:53.088
Which of the two of us
would give you a quiet life?

44:38.217 --> 44:39.843
You're a lot braver than I thought.

44:39.927 --> 44:42.554
What if the wrong person
saw you at a place like this?

44:43.305 --> 44:45.265
You need to leave my husband alone.

44:47.893 --> 44:50.312
You won't ever have him again.
You're done.

44:54.358 --> 44:56.318
Don't forget your place, In-ji.

44:56.402 --> 44:58.278
You're not being paid
to act out like this, okay?

44:58.362 --> 45:01.824
This is what you're paying me for.
You want me to act like a wife.

45:02.616 --> 45:03.992
It's pretend.

45:04.827 --> 45:06.620
And it's all over in a year.

45:09.206 --> 45:13.377
A year… is enough time for some people
to plan their own deaths.

45:14.044 --> 45:17.506
For others, it's lots of time
to keep on living and get stronger.

45:17.589 --> 45:19.425
It's enough time to bear a child,

45:20.759 --> 45:23.387
and you just spoiled that, didn't you?

45:26.140 --> 45:28.934
That child who would've taken
its first breath

45:29.017 --> 45:30.602
and learned to adore you.

45:36.358 --> 45:38.402
What the fuck do you know anyway?

45:38.485 --> 45:40.571
Ah, you're just some low-rent bitch!

45:45.951 --> 45:49.079
Jeong-won saw you
jump into oncoming traffic that day.

45:50.456 --> 45:51.874
Listen, I'm saying he saw you

45:51.957 --> 45:54.293
throw your own unborn child
into the middle of the road.

45:56.670 --> 45:59.173
He blamed himself,
and he doesn't understand it.

45:59.256 --> 46:00.758
I guess you're off the hook again.

46:02.718 --> 46:06.138
I promise you this. There is no way
I'll let you ruin our marriage

46:06.221 --> 46:08.307
or Jeong-won's chance at a new life.

46:10.601 --> 46:13.353
I want him to feel content
and hopeful again.

46:13.979 --> 46:15.606
Now tell me what it is you want.

46:23.655 --> 46:24.656
You should go.

46:25.741 --> 46:27.242
You stay here much longer,

46:27.785 --> 46:30.662
and I would have to tell Jeong-won
a whole lot more about you.

46:30.746 --> 46:32.039
We don't want that.

46:33.916 --> 46:37.795
I know you're a little… curious
what I know about you, Seo-yeon.

47:29.972 --> 47:33.100
There's only one son
but two daughters-in-law.

47:33.767 --> 47:34.726
So crazy.

47:45.654 --> 47:47.281
Well, Seo-yeon is gone now.

47:51.535 --> 47:53.161
And I'm by your side today.

47:57.416 --> 47:59.126
What about the manual, In-ji?

48:00.627 --> 48:01.628
I'll…

48:04.506 --> 48:05.757
just take the day off.

48:05.841 --> 48:07.718
♪ You don't have to stay ♪

48:08.218 --> 48:10.387
♪ Just let the past decay ♪

48:10.470 --> 48:14.266
♪ 'Cause I know it's not your fault ♪

48:15.767 --> 48:18.312
♪ You think you're not enough ♪

48:18.395 --> 48:21.356
♪ But I know we'll make it through ♪

48:21.440 --> 48:24.359
♪ Just escape from the darkness ♪

48:26.236 --> 48:28.322
♪ I won't let you drown ♪

48:28.405 --> 48:31.283
♪ I can pull you out of shadows ♪

48:31.366 --> 48:35.037
♪ Just hold my hand, and we'll be fine ♪

48:35.537 --> 48:37.664
♪ Turn around ♪

48:37.748 --> 48:38.916
♪ Oh ♪

48:38.999 --> 48:42.878
♪ Baby, I'll be your savior ♪

48:47.758 --> 48:49.593
♪ What if we die? ♪

48:50.260 --> 48:55.432
♪ We cannot be happy
If there's nothing to lose ♪

48:57.976 --> 48:59.978
♪ What if we try ♪

49:00.479 --> 49:01.480
♪ To stay alive? ♪

49:01.563 --> 49:05.275
♪ Will we ever be free from the past? ♪

49:05.776 --> 49:08.236
♪ What do we live for? ♪

49:09.363 --> 49:10.530
♪ Mm-mm ♪

49:11.031 --> 49:14.034
♪ What do we live for? ♪

49:15.953 --> 49:18.205
♪ What do we live for…? ♪

49:18.288 --> 49:23.210
MY SINCERE CONDOLENCES
LEE SEO-YEON

49:26.171 --> 49:28.799
♪ What do we live for? ♪

49:31.385 --> 49:33.971
♪ What do we live for? ♪

49:35.764 --> 49:38.976
Let's hit a spa first.
You look pretty rough right now.

49:42.187 --> 49:43.647
You ever not been picked, Ji-o?

49:46.858 --> 49:48.527
Let's say there's you and Cheol-su,

49:49.111 --> 49:52.114
and if Cheol-su gets selected,
then you die, ya know?

49:53.240 --> 49:55.117
Well, yeah,
I've always been picked for things.

49:56.368 --> 49:59.037
Never been in
a concentration camp scenario though.

50:01.790 --> 50:03.792
I was always the one doing the choosing.

50:04.376 --> 50:07.295
If I didn't like a teacher,
I switched to another homeroom.

50:08.130 --> 50:10.966
Always found a way to move
next to the kids I wanted to sit with.

50:11.049 --> 50:13.301
I got what I wanted, whether it was

50:14.428 --> 50:16.638
friend groups or tutors.

50:18.265 --> 50:19.975
Men were never an issue,

50:20.058 --> 50:22.811
so I didn't mind
when I'd get called a shrew or skank.

50:23.812 --> 50:25.480
Come on. All of a sudden, you

50:26.565 --> 50:28.567
feel wronged over a few nasty words?

50:29.317 --> 50:30.485
Why am I

50:31.737 --> 50:34.990
feeling like the whole world
revolves around Noh In-ji lately?

50:36.158 --> 50:39.828
She was just supposed to be quiet
and play second fiddle to me for a year.

50:43.123 --> 50:45.876
But now I've become the Cheol-su
who didn't get picked.

50:58.805 --> 51:00.265
LATE HAN YEONG-HO

51:04.561 --> 51:05.729
You should turn in.

51:06.271 --> 51:08.231
I am pretty sure that's it for guests.

51:11.818 --> 51:12.986
I can't waste this.

51:16.948 --> 51:18.033
It's your day off.

51:25.415 --> 51:26.750
You wanna go do something?

51:56.947 --> 51:58.156
You're driving blind now.

52:00.367 --> 52:01.701
I can't see, for real.

52:03.203 --> 52:04.746
I feel like I can't even see the lights.

52:05.372 --> 52:07.499
Oh, I… I can see.

52:07.582 --> 52:09.334
What is with these?

52:15.507 --> 52:17.050
Why is it so empty in here?

52:17.843 --> 52:20.053
I chose a really unpopular movie tonight.

52:20.137 --> 52:21.346
Oh, good.

52:23.014 --> 52:24.349
Smells like incense.

52:26.768 --> 52:27.811
You're right.

52:35.944 --> 52:37.028
It's all yours.

52:51.793 --> 52:53.086
This one would look good on you.

52:57.716 --> 52:58.884
Hey, don't shrink.

53:02.679 --> 53:06.016
It reminds me of
one of those piano covers.

53:08.226 --> 53:09.060
Huh?

53:16.693 --> 53:17.694
Turn around.

53:30.248 --> 53:31.333
What's so funny?

53:32.584 --> 53:34.544
I feel like I just left a bathhouse.

53:36.463 --> 53:38.924
I went to one with some friends
when I was little.

53:40.759 --> 53:43.511
When I came out,
I saw I still had suds on my head.

53:45.305 --> 53:47.515
Still, it was refreshing and a lot of fun.

53:49.309 --> 53:51.061
Although I had to rinse off again.

53:55.774 --> 53:57.525
I don't get it. My father's dead.

53:58.109 --> 54:00.070
I feel like I shouldn't be this happy.

54:02.781 --> 54:04.908
Not everybody's father
deserves to be mourned.

54:04.991 --> 54:06.159
It's not your fault.

54:07.202 --> 54:09.037
The same thing goes for mothers too.

54:11.706 --> 54:12.791
Did your mother

54:14.251 --> 54:16.419
really kill that person, like you said?

54:19.297 --> 54:21.967
Well, if you count social death,
then, yeah, probably.

54:24.344 --> 54:27.639
Sambin Electronics'
International Business Team. Mr. Seo.

54:28.765 --> 54:30.225
I'm sure you've heard of him.

54:31.268 --> 54:33.270
The video did go viral, after all.

54:34.396 --> 54:35.939
That was where my mom worked.

54:38.275 --> 54:41.903
She found out her daughter was about to
run off and marry a bisexual man,

54:42.529 --> 54:45.824
so she outed him to the entire nation
ten days before the wedding.

54:47.450 --> 54:50.745
So many people were calling me
that the battery in my phone didn't work.

54:51.246 --> 54:54.040
They thought I didn't know
and I was a victim in the situation.

54:59.421 --> 55:01.548
I couldn't get a hold of him.
I missed his calls.

55:02.424 --> 55:04.259
Or that's what I decided to believe.

55:05.677 --> 55:08.388
'Cause when someone you know so well
just vanishes, it

55:10.140 --> 55:11.308
makes no sense at all.

55:14.811 --> 55:16.021
You still waiting?

55:25.113 --> 55:26.031
What if…

55:29.701 --> 55:32.954
later on, I don't wanna be… without you?

55:38.293 --> 55:39.210
I could

55:40.378 --> 55:41.963
feel that way, I think.

55:54.893 --> 55:56.519
LATE HAN YEONG-HO

56:42.732 --> 56:45.443
I found out where
Seo-yeon's been getting her drugs.

58:10.320 --> 58:12.071
Sitting here like this is, uh,

58:13.490 --> 58:14.324
amusing.

58:17.035 --> 58:20.246
Your father is undoubtedly proud of you
as he moves on to the afterlife.

58:24.918 --> 58:26.127
What's this about?

58:28.505 --> 58:29.380
You're done.

58:38.306 --> 58:40.141
You're getting a divorce, In-ji.
